arias para demostrar que lo que dice es cierto. En unas horas les dirá quién de ellos es el asesino. Marcos se siente incapaz de seguir esperando, necesita respuestas. Baja a hablar con el hombre misterioso y éste le explica cuál es su verdadero plan: les ha citado a todos por la noche para contarles quién mató a Carol, pero el asesino bajará antes para matarle. Así se delatará.","production_code":"","runtime":75,"season_number":7,"show_id":4743,"still_path":"/lj6IFKII8pm1y8zey0a9peIwjqr.jpg","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"crew":[{"job":"Writer","department":"Writing","credit_id":"604bad81982f740058bcb175","adult":false,"gender":0,"id":2504292,"known_for_department":"Writing","name":"Abraham Sastre","original_name":"Abraham Sastre","popularity":0.6534,"profile_path":null},{"job":"Writer","department":"Writing","credit_id":"603b92e6a2e602208ef2f89e","adult":false,"gender":0,"id":2814070,"known_for_department":"Writing","name":"Carlos García Miranda","original_name":"Carlos García Miranda","popularity":0.6134,"profile_path":"/y95lYpY2RYSzbEovvEqSYOAt6O0.jpg"},{"job":"Director","department":"Directing","credit_id":"608b44e7764841005955e015","adult":false,"gender":0,"id":2419754,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Antonio Díaz Huerta","original_name":"Antonio Díaz Huerta","popularity":0.4982,"profile_path":"/bC0vWbKrJmT1N35WhCuWR28zobl.jpg"},{"job":"Writer","department":"Writing","credit_id":"6094377f87a27a00796dac25","adult":false,"gender":0,"id":3081292,"known_for_department":"Writing","name":"Daniel Martínez Mantilla","original_name":"Daniel Martínez Mantilla","popularity":0.3074,"profile_path":null},{"job":"Writer","department":"Writing","credit_id":"60943aeea6d93100580a5e2b","adult":false,"gender":0,"id":2504291,"known_for_department":"Writing","name":"Sara Belloso","original_name":"Sara Belloso","popularity":0.4973,"profile_path":null}],"guest_stars":[{"character":"Vanesa Morales","credit_id":"6611d68c1fa1c80163d1de58","order":502,"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":1039652,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Carmen Sánchez","original_name":"Carmen Sánchez","popularity":0.718,"profile_path":"/zwHjWIhbnSXhXgyjwczGFcj4W6T.jpg"}]},{"air_date":"2010-07-21","episode_number":8,"episode_type":"standard","id":342505,"name":"El último deseo","overview":"María ha descubierto que Rubén se hacía pasar por Hugo. Corría alrededor del colegio cubierto con una capucha, de forma que nadie podía distinguirles y el profesor de deporte disponía de todo ese tiempo para hacer lo que quisiera contando con una sólida coartada. Rubén, al verse sorprendido, no supo reaccionar y golpeó a la limpiadora dejándola inconsciente. Cuando se lo cuenta a Hugo éste lo tiene claro: hay que encontrar a la limpiadora y acabar con lo que Rubén empezó. Hay que rematar a María. A punta de pistola, Roque encierra a sus amigos en los pasadizos y se lleva la cuerda sin la cual es imposible salir de la planta subterránea","production_code":"","runtime":67,"season_number":7,"show_id":4743,"still_path":"/jBqqt4UwhWHwkc9g919Gaa2UlAA.jpg","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"crew":[{"job":"Writer","department":"Writing","credit_id":"604bacec1d78f200577d6761","adult":false,"gender":0,"id":3008006,"known_for_department":"Writing","name":"Ester Ruiz","original_name":"Ester Ruiz","popularity":0.3518,"profile_path":null},{"job":"Writer","department":"Writing","credit_id":"608b465df8aee800290362fb","adult":false,"gender":2,"id":2062904,"known_for_department":"Writing","name":"Nico Romero","original_name":"Nico Romero","popularity":0.4686,"profile_path":"/wZxt7VbyKlCQJRJEEK6LDH7QV5k.jpg"},{"job":"Director","department":"Directing","credit_id":"608b45153852020057370abc","adult":false,"gender":2,"id":980973,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Miguel Alcantud","original_name":"Miguel Alcantud","popularity":0.5877,"profile_path":"/2280eyVZ7zH0i3G4ejgBWgIUcxH.jpg"},{"job":"Writer","department":"Writing","credit_id":"60943adbcee2f600297b1a12","adult":false,"gender":0,"id":1474