 con Héctor y murió hace semanas.","production_code":"","runtime":81,"season_number":7,"show_id":4743,"still_path":"/mUwCQ98SbWQaolVTmJqUQmheX89.jpg","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"crew":[{"job":"Writer","department":"Writing","credit_id":"604bacec1d78f200577d6761","adult":false,"gender":0,"id":3008006,"known_for_department":"Writing","name":"Ester Ruiz","original_name":"Ester Ruiz","popularity":0.3518,"profile_path":null},{"job":"Writer","department":"Writing","credit_id":"608b465df8aee800290362fb","adult":false,"gender":2,"id":2062904,"known_for_department":"Writing","name":"Nico Romero","original_name":"Nico Romero","popularity":0.4686,"profile_path":"/wZxt7VbyKlCQJRJEEK6LDH7QV5k.jpg"},{"job":"Director","department":"Directing","credit_id":"608b45153852020057370abc","adult":false,"gender":2,"id":980973,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Miguel Alcantud","original_name":"Miguel Alcantud","popularity":0.5877,"profile_path":"/2280eyVZ7zH0i3G4ejgBWgIUcxH.jpg"},{"job":"Writer","department":"Writing","credit_id":"60943adbcee2f600297b1a12","adult":false,"gender":0,"id":1474492,"known_for_department":"Creator","name":"Nuria Bueno","original_name":"Nuria Bueno","popularity":0.3849,"profile_path":null},{"job":"Writer","department":"Writing","credit_id":"60943aeea6d93100580a5e2b","adult":false,"gender":0,"id":2504291,"known_for_department":"Writing","name":"Sara Belloso","original_name":"Sara Belloso","popularity":0.4973,"profile_path":null}],"guest_stars":[{"character":"Sara","credit_id":"55489a8d9251415609001b8e","order":500,"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":1149826,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Paloma Bloyd","original_name":"Paloma Bloyd","popularity":1.1081,"profile_path":"/1MBEPN0Y4YvIJAw3WOqBOeALDFT.jpg"}]},{"air_date":"2010-09-27","episode_number":12,"episode_type":"standard","id":342517,"name":"Hasta que la muerte los separe","overview":"Fermín quiere casarse con María y le regala el anillo de compromiso que lleva generaciones en su familia. Aunque María tiene dudas, Fermín encontrará una cómplice perfecta en Jacinta, que incluso se ofrece para arreglar un viejo vestido de novia que tiene guardado. Entre los dos convencen a María: la boda se celebrará esa misma noche. Sólo una travesura de las niñas está a punto de dar al traste con la celebración, pues el anillo acaba en el estómago de Javier Holgado… Vicky se debate entre la vida y la muerte. El anestésico que le inyectó el Teniente es muy potente y puede que no se recupere.","production_code":"","runtime":73,"season_number":7,"show_id":4743,"still_path":"/qaobWvw8TdiEeCJcPm8GjR3g2N9.jpg","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"crew":[{"job":"Writer","department":"Writing","credit_id":"604bae9466a0d3005a828244","adult":false,"gender":0,"id":1998078,"known_for_department":"Writing","name":"Luis Murillo Arias","original_name":"Luis Murillo Arias","popularity":0.4679,"profile_path":null},{"job":"Writer","department":"Writing","credit_id":"604bacdba35c8e0044dd97d4","adult":false,"gender":2,"id":2504290,"known_for_department":"Writing","name":"Asier Anduenza","original_name":"Asier Anduenza","popularity":0.5576,"profile_path":null},{"job":"Director","department":"Directing","credit_id":"608b44e7764841005955e015","adult":false,"gender":0,"id":2419754,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Antonio Díaz Huerta","original_name":"Antonio Díaz Huerta","popularity":0.4982,"profile_path":"/bC0vWbKrJmT1N35WhCuWR28zobl.jpg"},{"job":"Writer","department":"Writing","credit_id":"609438d51fb94f0027ac01fc","adult":false,"gender":2,"id":2191683,"known_for_department":"Creator","name":"Curro Serrano","original_name":"Curro Serrano","popularity":0.4734,"profile_path":null}],"guest_stars":[]},{"air_date":"2010-10-04","episode_number":13,"episode_type":"standard","id":342535,"name":"El último aliento","overview":"Elsa se encuentra cada vez más débil. Lleva más de 48 horas enferma pues nunca llegó a tomar la medicina. Todo indica que será la primera víctima mortal del virus desde que empezó la cuarentena. Consciente de la gravedad de su situación, la directora del Laguna Negra se enfrenta con serenidad y valentía a las que cree que son sus últimas horas de vida. Fermín y Rebeca se infiltran con éxito en el campamento militar. Pronto localizan a Max, la única persona capaz de salvarles la vida, pero ¿cómo sacarle de allí? El mismo Max les hace ver que llevarle a él de vuelta al internado no servirá para nada si no consiguen también el material radioactivo necesario para hacer funcionar la máquina que les curará Rubén hace correr la voz de que todos van a morir, desatando el pánico entre los alumnos del Laguna Negra: todos exigen salir de allí como sea y no atienden a razones.","production_code":"","runtime":75,"season_number":7,"show_id":4743,"still_path":"/cKrtzh7Q6TQ0z8CgLdqTghH4lnd.jpg","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"crew":[{"job":"Director","department":"Directing","credit_id":"60413b27d71fb4002b601317","adult":false,"gender":0,"id":2954355,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Alexandra Graf","original_name":"Alexandra Graf","popularity":0.428,"profile_path":null},{"job":"Writer","department":"Writing","credit_id":"604bad81982f740058bcb175","adult":false,"gender":0,"id":2504292,"known_for_department":"Writing","name":"Abraham Sastre","original_name":"Abraham Sastre","popularity":0.6534,"profile_path":null},{"job":"Writer","department":"Writing","credit_id":"603b92e6a2e602208ef2f89e","adult":false,"gender":0,"id":2814070,"known_for_department":"Writing","name":"Carlos García Miranda","original_name":"Carlos García Miranda","popularity":0.6134,"profile_path":"/y95lYpY2RYSzbEovvEqSYOAt6O0.jpg"},{"job":"Writer","department":"Writing","credit_id":"6094377f87a27a00796dac25","adult":false,"gender":0,"id":3081292,"known_for_department":"Writing","name":"Daniel Martínez Mantilla","original_name":"Daniel Martínez Mantilla","popularity":0.3074,"profile_path":null},{"job":"Writer","department":"Writing","credit_id":"60943aeea6d93100580a5e2b","adult":false,"gender":0,"id":2504291,"known_for_department":"Writing","name":"Sara Belloso","original_name":"Sara Belloso","popularity":0.4973,"profile_path":null}],"guest_stars":[{"character":"Héctor de la Vega","credit_id":"550dd8c2c3a3684886006e0b","order":0,"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":1443563,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Luis Merlo","original_name":"Luis Merlo","popularity":0.9757,"profile_path":"/2hE7L0oKlrYAXCWphosKWdkxgJ6.jpg"},{"character":"Sara","credit_id":"55489a8d9251415609001b8e","order":500,"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":1149826,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Paloma Bloyd","original_name":"Paloma Bloyd","popularity":1.1081,"profile_path":"/1MBEPN0Y4YvIJAw3WOqBOeALDFT.jpg"}]},{"air_date":"2010-10-11","episode_number":14,"episode_type":"standard","id":342525,"name":"La luz","overview":"Rubén intenta utilizar a Paula como moneda de cambio para salir del cerco militar, pero Camilo le golpea y le deja inconsciente y la pequeña consigue escapar. Cuando Marcos encuentra a su hermana en medio del bosque, Paula se encuentra en estado de shock, incapaz de articular palabra. Cuando por fin recupera el habla, le cuenta algo que puede cambiarlo todo. Mientras tanto, a pocos metros de allí, Héctor ha conseguido por fin escapar del lugar donde permanecía atrapado desde el derrumbe de los pasadizos. El reencuentro con su familia está cada vez más cerca. A unos metros de distancia, Alicia y el Teniente descuelgan el cadáver de Roque ante la mirada de horror de Vicky, Iván y Julia.","production_code":"","runtime":70,"season_number":7,"show_id":4743,"still_path":"/ijjpQlffj42sstcEAYp3AV9FN5J.jpg","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"crew":[{"job":"Writer","department":"Writing","credit_id":"604bacec1d78f200577d6761","adult":false,"gender":0,"id":3008006,"known_for_department":"Writing","name":"Ester Ruiz","original_name":"Ester Ruiz","popularity":0.3518,"profile_path":null},{"job":"Writer","department":"Writing","credit_id":"603b92e6a2e602208ef2f89e","adult":f